		# each slot actually has 8 chars
		# slot indexes are 0, 1, 2, 3, 4 = touhou_toyohime_puzzle_sel_slot
		# pos indexes are 0, 1, 2, 3 = touhou_toyohime_puzzle_sel_pos
		# every slots' check item: idx == touhou_toyohime_puzzle_check_idx, pos == touhou_toyohime_puzzle_check_pos
		#
		# when touhou_toyohime_puzzle_slot_[idx]_pos_[arr_pos] is [i], display GFX_btn_touhou_automate_puzzle_[white/red]_char[i].
		# if touhou_toyohime_puzzle_sel_slot is at current, use red, else white.
		# when press w/s, move up/downward the char window,
		# when press a/d, self-dec/inc touhou_toyohime_puzzle_sel_slot.
		# char window array: touhou_toyohime_puzzle_chars_[idx]_[0-7]
		# arr_pos = 0-3 + touhou_toyohime_puzzle_chars_offset_[idx], so the offset range must be [0, 4]
		#
		# char to be checked: touhou_toyohime_puzzle_seq_[idx]
		# controls which are not grey: idx == touhou_toyohime_puzzle_check_idx, pos == touhou_toyohime_puzzle_check_pos
		# next 4 buttons are hidden, but can be use for input stratagem code.
